    {
      "id": "kpk1-l00-e-t02",
      "before": "kpk1-l00-e-e07",
      "kind": "uwaga",
      "title": {
        "en": "A man's word in -a"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Kolega* ends in *-a*, and it is masculine. Most words in *-a* are feminine, but a word for a man is masculine whatever its ending. So it is *kolega* for a man and *koleżanka* for a woman."
      }
    }
